'''''Farther Than The Snow Plains''''' is a [[Companion Mission]] in the chapter [[Slices of Life Before the Furnace]].

==Steps==
# Head to the Museum Finishing Room to find the Landau siblings
# Talk with the Landau siblings
# Head to the Administrative District exit near the Outlying Snow Plains and find Lynx
# Head to the Snow Plains and find Lynx
# Say goodbye to Pela and Lynx for now
# Reply to the messages from the Landau siblings
# Report your findings from the Snow Plains to the Landau siblings
# Reply to Lynx's message
# Head to the museum to find the two
# Return to the Neverwinter Workshop with Lynx
# Listen to all the Landau siblings talk to each other

