:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Here I am.
:<!--0.5-second delay-->
:'''Serval:''' Oh, (Trailblazer)! We were just waiting for you.
:'''Gepard:''' Long time no see, (Trailblazer). I wanted to talk about this in our chat group, but sis won't have it... I'm sorry you had to run all the way out here.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} More danger afoot?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why all the hush-hush?
::'''Gepard:''' Um... That was Serval's idea. She said it needed a level of secrecy.
::'''Gepard:''' I happened to be helping out at the museum, so we both ended up waiting for you here.
:'''Serval:''' Actually, I want to talk to you about our little Lynx.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Lynx?
::'''Gepard:''' She's our little sister, the youngest child of the Landau family.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Oh, that Lynx.
::'''Gepard:''' So you know her! Well, that makes this easy.
:'''Gepard:''' She just came back from a scientific exploration on the Snow Plains, but she seems really out of it... almost like she's worried about something...
:'''Gepard:''' And she won't tell us what happened. We're really worried and want to help, but we don't know where to start.
:'''Serval:''' The last time I saw her, she was preparing to meet someone on the Snow Plains. She even asked for a stove set from me...
:'''Serval:''' But no matter how Gepard and I asked and probed, Lynx simply refused to tell us who she was gonna meet... *sigh* I'm such a failure of a sister.
:'''Serval:''' So, that's why Gepard and I came up with this idea. We'd like you to help us find out what's going on!
:'''Gepard:''' One more thing... don't let her discover you. Otherwise, she'll probably get upset with us.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Leave it to me!
::'''Serval:''' Thank you, (Trailblazer)! We're worried about her meeting strangers...
::'''Gepard:''' She's used to doing research alone in the Snow Plains, and we've always believed she can protect herself, but this is different... I'm worried she could run into bad people.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That might be difficult...
::'''Serval:''' I know she's used to going into the Snow Plains alone for research, and we've always believed she can protect herself...
::'''Gepard:''' But this is different. We're worried about her running into strangers... She might get herself into trouble.
:'''Serval:''' Oh, right! If you're gonna go find Lynxy, you gotta know what she looks like!
:'''Serval:''' Don't worry. She stands out. She's blonde like us and, um... quite short. She's always wearing a white fur hat... If I'm right, she should be waiting for someone at the city exit closest to the Snow Plains.
:'''Serval:''' We are putting our dearest baby sister in your hands this time. Let us know immediately if anything happens.
:'''Gepard:''' Thank you, (Trailblazer).
----
{{Dialogue End}}

