===Say goodbye to Pela and Lynx for now{{subst:void|<!--201141106-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Administrative District|update|The trip to observe the Snow Plains aurora is now over. You achieve a happy ending, but the two girls seem to want to make this trip even more special.<br />They booked you to have supper together later in the day. For now, find a way to spend your time and wait for them to get ready.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Pela:''' So awesome... I got to taste Lynxy's cooking and see the aurora... This Snow Plains adventure was the best!
:'''Lynx:''' You look really happy.
:'''Pela:''' Huh? Me?
:'''Pela:''' Ahem! I&mdash;I'm not THAT happy. I, wh&mdash;what I mean is, uh...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Say what's on your mind!
::'''Lynx:''' Yeah, go for it, Pela.
::'''Pela:''' I...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Lynx will be upset...
::'''Pela:''' Huh!? I... I hope not...
::'''Lynx:''' It's okay. I won't be sad. I understand what Pela really feels.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You weren't just here for the camping?
::'''Pela:''' I was going to say that... but now I suddenly don't want to.
::'''Lynx:''' I understand what Pela really feels. You don't need to hide it.
:'''Pela:''' *sigh* It was a great experience... thanks to you Lynxy... not to mention you, (Trailblazer).
