===Head to the museum to find the two{{subst:void|<!--201141110-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=History and Culture Museum|update|The trip to observe the Snow Plains aurora is now over. You achieve a happy ending, but the two girls seem to want to make this trip even more special.<br />Lynx seems to have finished her preparations and invites to you to go to the museum together to find Pela.<br />Go to the museum as per her request and meet up with the two of them.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Lynx:''' Ah, you're here too.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yep.
::'''Lynx:''' Then let's wait for Pela together. She's in the storage room.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're here early, Lynx.
::'''Lynx:''' Mm-hmm. I went back, stored my supplies, and had a shower. It didn't take long.
::'''Lynx:''' Let's wait for Pela together. She's in the storage room.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is Pela not here yet?
::'''Lynx:''' She's in the storage room. Let's wait for her.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What's she doing in there?
:'''Lynx:''' I think she's looking over the contents of that floppy disk... Let's give her some time.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What's in the floppy disk?
::'''Lynx:''' I don't know the exact details, but...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So, she might be a while...?
:'''Lynx:''' ...
:'''Lynx:''' I'm guessing you don't know about Pela's mother, right?
:'''Lynx:''' Penya Sergeyevna was Belobog's greatest outdoor explorer &mdash; passed away sixteen years ago.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That name sounds familiar.
::'''Lynx:''' She's famous in Belobog. You might have heard other people mention her in passing.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Pela never mentioned...
::'''Lynx:''' Mm, she doesn't usually talk about it.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You sure it's okay to tell me this?
:::'''Lynx:''' I asked her already... and she said it was fine. She seems like she really trusts you.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I can understand why...
:::'''Lynx:''' Looks like Pela was right in trusting you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Cocolia allowed explorations outside of the city?
::'''Lynx:''' The exploration team belonged to the Silvermane Guards at the time, so they had authorization.
:'''Lynx:''' *sigh* Anyway, something else happened sixteen years ago...
:'''Lynx:''' ...Pela was born.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You mean...
:'''Lynx:''' ...Yes.
:'''Lynx:''' They say that despite her pregnancy, Madam Penya insisted on staying at the Snow Plains camp. She couldn't go to the front lines, but she was able to handle administrative duties.
:'''Lynx:''' Then, finally... the day of Pela's birth arrived.
:'''Lynx:''' Tragically, there were complications... Other serious incidents occurred that day &mdash; the exploration team ran into a blizzard and the camp lost contact with the outside world... No one knew what to do.
:'''Lynx:''' The only good thing... was that Pela was born healthy.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I never knew any of this...
::'''Lynx:''' ...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So what about the floppy disk?
:'''Lynx:''' The floppy disk... If the old research team members were telling the truth...
:'''Lynx:''' ...it was something Madam Penya left behind.
----
