===Listen to all the Landau siblings talk to each other{{subst:void|<!--201141112-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Neverwinter Workshop|update|Lynx seems to be emotionally affected because of Pela. She asks you to go back to the Neverwinter workshop with her, and seems to have something to say to her siblings.<br />Listen to what Lynx has to say.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Lynx:''' ...
:'''Lynx:''' Serval, Gepard...
:'''Lynx:''' ...
:'''Lynx:''' ...I'm back!
:'''Gepard:''' Lynx! You're finally back...
:'''Gepard:''' Uh, what's with the red eyes? Did something happen?
:'''Serval:''' ...Gepard! Way to make it obvious.
:'''Serval:''' Welcome home, Lynxy.
:'''Lynx:''' Mm...
:'''Serval:''' Aww, it's okay. It's okay...
:'''Serval:''' Seems like a lot went down in the Snow Plains. Thanks again for your help, (Trailblazer).
