:'''Gepard:''' Huh? Ah... Yes, of course.
:'''Gepard:''' But I have to say, Lynx... I think it's too dangerous for you to leave the city on your own...
:'''Serval:''' *sigh* Gepard! Are you quite finished?
{{Dialogue End}}

